UR  - https://github.com/FSUcaplab/dxa-extractor
AB  - Command-line tool for batch-extracting body composition and bone density results from Hologic DXA PDF reports into a single CSV file, built for longitudinal research studies with pre/post or multi-timepoint scan designs. Identifies report pages by content, reads regional fat, lean and bone mineral content, bone mineral density with T- and Z-scores, android and gynoid regions, visceral adipose tissue and the adipose and lean indices, keeps the most precise printed copy of each value, flags limbs the scanner mirrored from the opposite side, and checks each report's internal arithmetic.
